:1\"><div class=\"detail-card-module__oRuUjG__root ruled detail-card-module__oRuUjG__center investment-approach-module__--RwsW__card\"><span class=\"text-module__DYGPWq__root text-module__DYGPWq__label-medium text-module__DYGPWq__weight-medium detail-card-module__oRuUjG__number\">02</span><h3 class=\"text-module__DYGPWq__root text-module__DYGPWq__headline-large text-module__DYGPWq__weight-medium detail-card-module__oRuUjG__title\"><span class=\"sheen-text-module__IBglNG__root\"><span class=\"sheen-text-module__IBglNG__word\"><span class=\"sheen-text-module__IBglNG__text\">Systematic</span><span class=\"sheen-text-module__IBglNG__probe\"></span><span class=\"sheen-text-module__IBglNG__still\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Systematic</span><canvas class=\"sheen-text-module__IBglNG__canvas\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></canvas></span></span></h3><p class=\"text-module__DYGPWq__root text-module__DYGPWq__body-large text-module__DYGPWq__color-foreground-50 detail-card-module__oRuUjG__body\">Data-driven and quantitative strategies that seek to identify repeatable opportunities across liquid digital markets.</p></div></li><li class=\"reveal-module__nuDBzW__root reveal-module__nuDBzW__fade-up\" style=\"--stagger:2\"><div class=\"detail-card-module__oRuUjG__root ruled detail-card-module__oRuUjG__center investment-approach-module__--RwsW__card\"><span class=\"text-module__DYGPWq__root text-module__DYGPWq__label-medium text-module__DYGPWq__weight-medium detail-card-module__oRuUjG__number\">03</span><h3 class=\"text-module__DYGPWq__root text-module__DYGPWq__headline-large text-module__DYGPWq__weight-medium detail-card-module__oRuUjG__title\"><span class=\"sheen-text-module__IBglNG__root\"><span class=\"sheen-text-module__IBglNG__word\"><span class=\"sheen-text-module__IBglNG__text\">Thematic</span><span class=\"sheen-text-module__IBglNG__probe\"></span><span class=\"sheen-text-module__IBglNG__still\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Thematic</span><canvas class=\"sheen-text-module__IBglNG__canvas\" aria-h